In-depth research

A question with many independent parts or sources can benefit from a research plan.

The Deep Research option starts a planner. The person reviews the plan before the
organizer runs its sections.
{% if has('run_subagent') %}

The organizer can send independent tasks with {{ tool('run_subagent') }}. Each briefing
has an objective, known facts and the result to bring back. The plan budget limits the
sub-agent runs. Each starts with the briefing and cannot see another sub-agent's work.
{% endif %}
